    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be prepared for a new strange minimalistic indie 2D horror pixel quest. Start your adventures in a dark quiet abandoned village with atmospheric gloomy mood, mystic story and old school pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong><u>Controls are super easy!</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click left and right buttons to walk around</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click anywhere on the screen to interact with closest object</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use and apply various items, which you will find in your quest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to survive in this crazy indie horror pixel quest!</p></li></ul>",
